1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,673
Everybody tells you
the algorithm decides

2
00:00:02,673 --> 00:00:03,607
who wins.

3
00:00:03,607 --> 00:00:06,436
I spent four years
believing that,

4
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:09,382
and it cost me about
eleven thousand

5
00:00:09,382 --> 00:00:11,940
hours of work I
would like back.

6
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:15,007
Here is what
actually happened.

7
00:00:15,456 --> 00:00:18,508
In 2021 I was
posting five times a

8
00:00:18,508 --> 00:00:19,156
week.

9
00:00:19,156 --> 00:00:22,133
Every video was
better than the

10
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:25,156
last one by any
measure I could

11
00:00:25,156 --> 00:00:25,614
name.

12
00:00:25,614 --> 00:00:27,536
Better lighting,
better audio,

13
00:00:27,536 --> 00:00:28,382
tighter edit.

14
00:00:28,708 --> 00:00:31,180
And the channel
did not move.

15
00:00:31,451 --> 00:00:33,879
Eight hundred
subscribers in January,

16
00:00:33,879 --> 00:00:36,156
nine hundred and
twelve in December.

17
00:00:37,443 --> 00:00:39,575
So I did what
everyone does.

18
00:00:39,874 --> 00:00:41,639
I blamed
the distribution.

19
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:44,370
I read every thread
about watch time and

20
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,775
session duration and
click-through rate.

21
00:00:46,775 --> 00:00:48,260
I bought two courses.

22
00:00:48,697 --> 00:00:51,596
I rewrote my titles
about forty times.
